{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.MathlibExt.ManifoldVolumeBridge","lean:module:QOU.Knot.FigureEightTriangulation","lean:module:QOU.Knot.Clausen"],"declarations":4,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_ne_zero_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_ne_zero_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FigureEightVolumeBridge.lean#L108-L115","doc":"**The 4₁ volume is not zero**, hence the triangulation is not degenerate. A corollary\nworth naming because a bridge whose `vol` collapsed to `0` would satisfy every transport\nstatement vacuously — the degenerate-model check, applied to the value rather than to the\nrelation. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_pos_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_pos_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FigureEightVolumeBridge.lean#L96-L106","doc":"**Positivity — derived, not assumed.**\n\n`ManifoldVolumeBridge` deliberately declines to carry positivity as a class field,\nbecause `0 < D(z)` on the upper half plane is not in the corpus. At the figure-eight it\ndoes not need to be assumed: `Cl_2_pi_div_three_pos` supplies it. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_eq_two_clausen_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_eq_two_clausen_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":90,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FigureEightVolumeBridge.lean#L90-L94","doc":"The same, spelled out: two regular ideal tetrahedra, each contributing `Cl₂(π/3)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_eq_VOL_4_1_of_realises","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.Encounter.FigureEightVolumeBridge.vol_eq_VOL_4_1_of_realises","kind":"theorem","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/Encounter/FigureEightVolumeBridge.lean#L78-L88","doc":"**A manifold realised by the 4₁ triangulation has volume exactly `VOL_4_1`.**\n\nComposes the bridge's transport with the corpus's sorry-free\n`figureEightTriangulation_volume`. Keyed on the exact constant rather than on\n`MostowRigidity.figureEight`'s truncated literal — see the module header for why the\nliteral version cannot be applied here. ","signatureChunk":0}]}